System logos

The system logos in src/assets/logos/ are NOT covered by the MIT License above.
The logos and trademarks they show belong to their respective owners. The SVG
files come from EmulationStation themes licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike (CC BY-NC-SA):

- es-theme-carbon by Fabrice Caruso
  https://github.com/fabricecaruso/es-theme-carbon
- Slate (ES-DE theme) by the ES-DE project
  https://gitlab.com/es-de/themes/slate-es-de
- The original set, most likely from es-theme-simple (RetroPie)

Many were recoloured to plain white to match the app. They may be used and
changed for non-commercial purposes, with credit, under the same license.

ES-DE launch configuration

The files in src-tauri/resources/esde/ (es_systems.xml and es_find_rules.xml for
each operating system) are copied unchanged from ES-DE (EmulationStation Desktop
Edition), https://gitlab.com/es-de/emulationstation-de, and are used to launch
games the same way ES-DE does. ES-DE is released under the MIT License:
Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Northwestern Software AB, (c) 2020-2024 Leon Styhre,
(c) 2014 Alec Lofquist. Its full license text is in src-tauri/resources/esde/LICENSE.
